                        "review": "Brilliant game, can't believe I never wrote a review back when I first played it. Fantastic concept (probably feels too close to home in today's world. I'd say playing it 10 years ago was absolutely mind blowing as a concept in regards to typing to a computer intelligence... can't say if it would have the same impact playing it afresh today... I much prefer AI as a sci fi than reality) BUT the story and environment are brilliant as well. Thoroughly enjoyed it and I'll happily return to it to replay",
